Z||000000||nivlek68||08-04-2000||10:12 PM||||got a door skin when i bought the car. painted it,removed the broken door skin and find out that they are differnt.the old one has the tabs on the top.new one does't.it has two plastic fastners along the top,and they don't line up with the holes in the door.anyone have any ideas that i might be able to do. please help me<BR>and thanks before hands in case i forget to say it later   kelvin||||reg||9
