Z||000002||Rodrv6||08-05-2000||12:58 AM||||I think the only skins with the 3 fasteners along the top edge were only on the early 84 models.  My 84 that I got in Feb, 84, has the push in fasteners at the top.  Another 84 that I took apart had the lip that went in a retainer on the top of the door frame.  The lip on the door frame is right where the holes for the push fasteners need to go.  I don't know if you can swap them easily or not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE||||reg||1
